---
const actualYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="rounded-4xl text-[#fefefe] my-11">
    <section
        class="newsletter bg-[#FBF8F2] p-8 py-14 rounded-t-4xl border-t border-r border-l border-[#aaa]"
    >
        <div>
            <h3
                class="capitalize text-4xl text-[#1e1e1e] opacity-70 text-center mx-auto mb-4"
            >
                Mantenete al tanto
            </h3>
            <p
                class="text-base text-[#1e1e1e] opacity-60 text-center mx-auto max-w-md"
            >
                Suscribite para actualizaciones exclusivas, ofertas especiales,
                y tips expertos para el cuidado de tus velas.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-11">
            <input
                type="text"
                placeholder="tunombre@email.com"
                class="placeholder-[#aaaaaa] text-[#1e1e1e] p-2 px-6 pr-11 min-w-sm text-base rounded-3xl border border-[#eee]"
            />
            <button
                class="text-base rounded-3xl p-2 px-10 bg-[#F6EEE8] text-[#1e1e1e]"
                >Unirme</button
            >
        </div>
    </section>
    <section
        class="links bg-[#756662] p-8 grid lg:grid-cols-3 grid-cols-1 place-items-center"
    >
        <div class="col-span-1">
            <h2 class="text-4xl">Velithas.</h2>
            <p class="max-w-sm py-4">
                Ilumina tu ambiente. Encende tu llama. <br /> Estamos comprometidos
                con darte el mejor <br /> servicio de velas aromáticas.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-medium text-[#fefefe] text-2xl">General</p>

                    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Inicio
                            </a>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Velas
                            </a>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Newsletter
                            </a>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Envios
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <p class="font-medium text-[#fefefe] text-2xl">Nosotros</p>

                    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Sobre
                            </a>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                Blog
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <p class="font-medium text-[#fefefe] text-2xl">Ayuda</p>

                    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                        <li>
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="text-[#ffffff] opacity-70 transition hover:opacity-75"
                            >
                                FAQs
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <div
        class="bg-[#1e1e1e] px-8 rounded-b-4xl py-4 grid grid-cols-3 place-items-center"
    >
        <p>Velithas {actualYear}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>

        <p>
            <svg
                width="40"
                height="40"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
                <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
                    d="M4 8a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4h8a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v8a4 4 0 0 1 -4 4h-8a4 4 0 0 1 -4 -4z"
                ></path>
                <path d="M9 12a3 3 0 1 0 6 0a3 3 0 0 0 -6 0"></path>
                <path d="M16.5 7.5v.01"></path>
            </svg>
        </p>
        <span></span>
    </div>
</footer>
